ses exhausted and finalization pending.\n\nInspect:\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.glassfish.pfl:pfl-dynamic:5.1.1/gradle-test/gradle-test-2026-09-27T12-39-44-745329Z.log`\n- `human-intervention-logs/org.glassfish.pfl:pfl-dynamic:5.1.1/issue-requested-metadata/pi-generation-2026-09-27T12-39-13-421768Z.log`\n- `forge/.continuation-marker.json` and `tests/src/org.glassfish.pfl/pfl-dynamic/5.1.1/dynamic-access-exhaust-report.json`\n\nManual next steps:\n1. Clean the coordinate’s build outputs and rerun the JVM/native tests to confirm the removed test is no longer executed.\n2. Rework the `java.lang.Object()` constructor registration to use an appropriate library-owned `typeReached` condition, then validate and rerun the native test.\n3. Review the four remaining call sites in the coverage report, add viable targeted tests if appropriate, and complete the coordinate-scoped verification gates.", "textSignature": "{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0596a4a352b3a186016ab90f0b9ce887d2984e3f50a895a4de\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}], "api": "openai-codex-responses", "provider": "openai-codex", "model": "gpt-5.6-sol", "usage": {"input": 30111, "output": 843, "cacheRead": 119936, "cacheWrite": 0, "reasoning": 396, "totalTokens": 150890, "cost": {"input": 0.120444, "output": 0.01686, "cacheRead": 0.04797440000000001, "cacheWrite": 0, "total": 0.18527839999999998}}, "stopReason": "stop", "timestamp": 1790512895425, "responseId": "resp_0596a4a352b3a186016ab90effb08c87d280edcef0a7914637", "rawStopReason": "completed"}, "toolResults": []}
